00:56:30,000 --> 00:56:36,000
Dark Shadows is a 2012 Gothic dark fantasy comedy horror film based
on the Gothic television soap opera of the same name.

12
01:01:38,181 --> 01:01:44,181
Directed by Tim Burton, the film stars Johnny Depp alongside Michelle Pfeiffer, Eva Green, Jackie Earle Haley,
Jonny Lee Miller, Chloë Grace Moretz, Helena Bonham Carter, and Bella Heathcote in a dual role.

13
01:06:46,363 --> 01:06:52,363
Christopher Lee has a small role in the film, marking his 200th film
appearance and his fifth and final collaboration with Burton.

14
01:11:54,545 --> 01:12:00,545
Jonathan Frid, star of the original Dark Shadows series, makes a cameo
appearance, and died shortly before the film was released.

15
01:17:02,727 --> 01:17:08,727
One of the film's producers, Richard D.

16
01:22:10,909 --> 01:22:16,909
Zanuck, died two months after its release.

17
01:27:19,090 --> 01:27:25,090
The film had a limited release on May 10, 2012, and was
officially released the following day in North America.

18
01:32:27,272 --> 01:32:33,272
It performed poorly at the United States box
office, but did well in foreign markets.

19
01:37:35,454 --> 01:37:41,454
Reviews for the film were mixed; critics praised its visual style and consistent humor,
but felt it lacked a focused or substantial plot and developed characters.

20
